</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.31</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.196</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">[ὁ] ἐρώμενος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.36</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">239a</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">737</span> </span> (pl.); <span class=\"gk\">τὸν ἐρώμενον αὐτοῦ,</span> Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">delicias ejus,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pol.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1303b23</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> without sexual reference, <b class=\"lex-tr\">love warmly,</b> opp. <span class=\"gk\">φιλέω, οὐδ' ἤρα οὐδ' ἐφίλει</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ly.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">222a</span> </span>:—and in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ὥστε οὐ μόνον φιλοῖο ἂν ἀλλὰ καὶ ἐρῷο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hier.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.11</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Brut.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">29</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κινεῖ [τὸ οὗ ἕνεκα] ὡς ἐρώμενον</span> <span clas